Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Physics hands the machine\Ntwo kinds of laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Some hold for every single snapshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:11.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Others hold only for the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Two shelves, still empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:18.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Back to the three dials, at a\N{\c&H7AAF1B&}Gamma{\c&HF7F4F2&} never seen in training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Grey: true snapshots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Violet: a plain {\c&HF09CB4&}generator{\c&HF7F4F2&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:26.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}The shape is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Now weigh the sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}The truth is balanced; the machine is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Only about four in ten of\Nits snapshots point up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}It copied its data: below the threshold,
